    62	          </div>
    63	          <aside className={styles.summary}>
    64	            <p>What this is</p>
    65	            <h2>An optimisation-and-expansion programme — not a greenfield launch.</h2>
    66	            <ul>
    67	              <li><ArrowRight size={17} /> Improve the existing Search engine</li>
    68	              <li><ArrowRight size={17} /> Add a focused Meta prospecting layer</li>
    69	              <li><ArrowRight size={17} /> Launch a dedicated conversion journey</li>
    70	              <li><ArrowRight size={17} /> Measure qualified pipeline, not soft actions</li>
    71	            </ul>
    72	          </aside>
    73	        </div>
    74	        <a className={styles.scrollCue} href="#reading-order"><ArrowDown size={17} /> Start reading</a>
    75	      </header>
    76	
    77	      <section className={styles.idea} id="reading-order">
    78	        <SectionHeading
    79	          label="Reading order"
    80	          title="Seven sections. Read them in order, or jump to what you need."
    81	          copy="Strategy is the fastest way in. Decisions is where your input is required. The remaining five sections are the detailed pack behind each recommendation."
    82	        />
    83	        <div className={styles.roadmap} style={{ gridTemplateColumns: "repeat(auto-fill, minmax(17rem, 1fr))" }}>
    84	          {readingOrder.map(([Icon, href, title, copy], index) => (
    85	            <Link key={href} href={href} className={styles.hubCard}>
    86	              <div className={styles.phaseHead}>
    87	                <span><Icon size={18} /></span>
    88	                <b aria-hidden="true">{String(index + 1).padStart(2, "0")}</b>
    89	              </div>
    90	              <h3>{title}</h3>
    91	              <p className={styles.hubCardCopy}>{copy}</p>
    92	              <span className={styles.hubCardGo}>Open <ArrowRight size={15} /></span>
    93	            </Link>
    94	          ))}
    95	        </div>
    96	      </section>
    97	
    98	      <section className={styles.questionsSection} id="decisions">
    99	        <div>
   100	          <SectionHeading
   101	            label="Your decisions · the short version"
   102	            title="What we need from you before implementation."
   103	            copy="The full list lives in Decisions. These are the ones that unblock everything else."
   104	          />
   105	          <p className={styles.planningOnly}>
   106	            This pack authorises planning only. It does not authorise changes to live advertising,
   107	            website, CRM or tracking systems.
   108	          </p>
   109	          <Link className={styles.pdfLink} href="/ergoworks/plan/decisions" style={{ marginTop: "2rem" }}>
   110	            All decisions <ArrowRight size={15} />
   111	          </Link>
   112	        </div>
   113	        <ol className={styles.questions}>
   114	          {decisions.map((q, i) => (
   115	            <li key={q}><span>{String(i + 1).padStart(2, "0")}</span><p>{q}</p></li>
   116	          ))}
   117	        </ol>
   118	      </section>
   119	
   120	      <section className={styles.stateSection} id="before-you-read">
   121	        <div className={styles.stateIntro}>
   122	          <SectionHeading label="Before you read" title="Two things to know." />
   123	          <p>
   124	            The recommendations are deliberately conservative where the numbers are not yet proven,
   125	            and deliberately explicit about compliance because this is a workplace-health category.
   126	          </p>
   127	        </div>
   128	        <div className={styles.stateList}>
   129	          <div>
   130	            <strong>Numbers are directional</strong>
   131	            <span>
   132	              Exact spend, cost-per-lead and account figures live in the private PDF pack, not on
   133	              these pages. Here you will see ranges, ratios and relative language — enough to make
   134	              the decisions, without publishing commercial detail.
   135	            </span>
   136	          </div>
   137	          <div>
   138	            <strong>Compliance is baked in</strong>
   139	            <span>
   140	              No claims of guaranteed injury prevention, WHS compliance or claims reduction. The
   141	              Snapshot is always described as preliminary guidance only — not a compliance
   142	              assessment, compliance certification, medical assessment or diagnosis. These are
   143	              Australian legal guardrails, not copy to be softened.
   144	            </span>
   145	          </div>
   146	        </div>
   147	      </section>
   148	
   149	      <section className={styles.offerSection} id="compliance">
   150	        <div className={styles.caveat} style={{ marginRight: "auto", marginLeft: "auto", maxWidth: "1200px" }}>
   151	          <ShieldCheck size={20} />
   152	          <p>
   153	            <strong>Compliance note:</strong> every mention of the Workplace Ergonomics Risk Snapshot
   154	            carries the caveat &ldquo;preliminary guidance only — not a compliance assessment,
   155	            compliance certification, medical assessment or diagnosis.&rdquo; Meta creative never
   156	            implies that a viewer or their staff has a health condition.
   157	          </p>
   158	        </div>
   159	      </section>
   160	
   161	      <footer className={styles.footer}>
   162	        <div className={styles.wordmark}><span>EW</span> ErgoWorks Consulting</div>
   163	        <p><CircleAlert size={13} style={{ verticalAlign: "-2px", marginRight: ".4rem" }} />Confidential · For client review only · Planning authorisation only</p>
   164	      </footer>
   165	    </main>
   166	  );
   167	}
   168	
   169	function SectionHeading({ label, title, copy }: { label: string; title: string; copy?: string }) {
   170	  return (
   171	    <div className={styles.sectionHeading}>
   172	      <p>{label}</p>
   173	      <h2>{title}</h2>
   174	      {copy ? <span>{copy}</span> : null}
   175	    </div>
   176	  );
   177	}
     1	/* ── Design system: copied verbatim from ../campaign-plan/page.module.css ──
